OL,3,GNEWSABridge demolition application
OL,4,Awithdrawn
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has withdrawn its application
OL,7,Fto demolish two former railway bridges
OL,8,Ffollowing criticism from a heritage
OL,9,Fgroup.
OL,11,FOn 25 August, Stockton Council said it
OL,12,Fplanned to take down the Crawford's and
OL,13,FBlack Squares bridges on the Castle
OL,14,FEden Walkway in Wynyard as they were at
OL,15,Frisk of collapse.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
