OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSABridge demolition application
OL,4,Awithdrawn
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Labour-led authority has now
OL,7,Fwithdrawn its prior notification
OL,8,Fproposal, which asks planners whether
OL,9,Fprior approval is needed in order to
OL,10,Fdemolish them to "provide more time"
OL,11,Ffor its heritage impact surveys to be
OL,12,Fconsidered.
OL,14,FCampaigners The HRE Group previously
OL,15,Fcalled for the bridges to be protected
OL,16,Fand maintained and said demolition
OL,17,Fwould be an "appalling waste of money".
